{
  "source": "..\\api\\mediainfo.md",
  "modules": [
    {
      "textRaw": "媒体信息 (MediaInfo)",
      "name": "媒体信息_(mediainfo)",
      "desc": "<p>mediainfo 模块用于读取媒体文件的容器, 视频, 音频, 字幕和其他流信息.</p>\n<p>此模块自 AutoJs6 6.7.0 起提供. <code>mediainfo</code> 与 <code>$mediainfo</code> 指向同一个可调用模块对象.</p>\n<p>自 AutoJs6 6.8.0 起, 媒体信息读取由外置 MediaInfo 插件提供. 调用前, 必须安装并启用与当前 AutoJs6 版本兼容的 MediaInfo 插件. 未发现可用插件引擎时, 调用将抛出异常.</p>\n<p>目标路径必须指向一个已存在的文件. 相对路径按当前脚本工作目录解析.</p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"font: bold 2em sans-serif; color: #FF7043\">mediainfo</p>\n\n<hr>\n",
      "modules": [
        {
          "textRaw": "[@] mediainfo",
          "name": "[@]_mediainfo",
          "methods": [
            {
              "textRaw": "mediainfo(path)",
              "type": "method",
              "name": "mediainfo",
              "desc": "<p><strong><code>6.7.0</code></strong> <strong><code>[6.8.0]</code></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>path</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> } - 媒体文件路径</li>\n<li><ins><strong>returns</strong></ins> { <a href=\"#mediainforesult\">MediainfoResult</a> } - 媒体信息对象</li>\n</ul>\n<p>读取媒体文件信息.</p>\n<p>此调用与 <a href=\"#m-read\">mediainfo.read(path)</a> 等价.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-js\">let info = mediainfo(&#39;./media/sample.mp4&#39;);\n\nconsole.log(info.path);\nconsole.log(info.general(&#39;Format&#39;));\nconsole.log(info.video(&#39;Width&#39;));\n</code></pre>\n",
              "signatures": [
                {
                  "params": [
                    {
                      "name": "path"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "type": "module",
          "displayName": "[@] mediainfo"
        },
        {
          "textRaw": "[m] read",
          "name": "[m]_read",
          "methods": [
            {
              "textRaw": "read(path)",
              "type": "method",
              "name": "read",
              "desc": "<p><strong><code>6.7.0</code></strong> <strong><code>[6.8.0]</code></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>path</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> } - 媒体文件路径</li>\n<li><ins><strong>returns</strong></ins> { <a href=\"#mediainforesult\">MediainfoResult</a> } - 媒体信息对象</li>\n</ul>\n<p>读取媒体文件信息.</p>\n<p>此方法会立即向 MediaInfo 插件请求完整报告, 将报告解析为对象属性, 并返回可继续查询各流类型的结果对象.</p>\n<hr>\n",
              "signatures": [
                {
                  "params": [
                    {
                      "name": "path"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "type": "module",
          "displayName": "[m] read"
        },
        {
          "textRaw": "MediainfoResult",
          "name": "mediainforesult",
          "desc": "<p>媒体信息结果对象.</p>\n<p>对象包含固定的 <code>path</code> 和 <code>inform</code> 属性, 以及 <code>general</code>, <code>video</code>, <code>audio</code>, <code>text</code>, <code>other</code>, <code>image</code>, <code>menu</code>, <code>max</code> 等可调用流查询对象.</p>\n<p>完整报告中的章节名称会转换为小写属性名. 章节内的字段名称会转换为 camelCase, 字段值均为字符串. 这些字段由目标文件和 MediaInfo 插件的报告内容动态决定.</p>\n<p>例如, 报告中的 <code>File size</code> 字段会转换为 <code>fileSize</code>:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-js\">let info = mediainfo.read(&#39;./media/sample.mp4&#39;);\n\nconsole.log(info.general.fileSize);\nconsole.log(info.video.format);\n</code></pre>\n<p>动态字段同时挂载在对应的可调用流查询对象上. 因此 <code>info.video</code> 既可作为函数调用, 也可读取其解析后的字段.</p>\n",
          "type": "module",
          "displayName": "MediainfoResult"
        },
        {
          "textRaw": "[p#] MediainfoResult#path",
          "name": "[p#]_mediainforesult#path",
          "desc": "<p><strong><code>6.7.0</code></strong> <strong><code>READONLY</code></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>{ <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> }</li>\n</ul>\n<p>目标媒体文件的绝对路径.</p>\n",
          "type": "module",
          "displayName": "[p#] MediainfoResult#path"
        },
        {
          "textRaw": "[p#] MediainfoResult#inform",
          "name": "[p#]_mediainforesult#inform",
          "desc": "<p><strong><code>6.7.0</code></strong> <strong><code>[6.8.0]</code></strong> <strong><code>READONLY</code></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>{ <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> }</li>\n</ul>\n<p>MediaInfo 插件返回的完整文本报告.</p>\n",
          "type": "module",
          "displayName": "[p#] MediainfoResult#inform"
        },
